  "solution": "Logic : (1st number - 2nd number) × 2 = (3rd number - 5)\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (36, 21, 35)\n\n**(36 - 21)**__ × 2 = __**35 - 5**__\n\n__**15 **__ __**× 2**__ = 30\n\n30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (43, 19, 53)\n\n(43 - 19)__ × 2 = **__53 - 5__**\n\n__24 ____× 2__ = 48\n\n48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (51, 34, 39)\n\n(51 - 34____)__ × 2 = __**39 - 5**__\n\n__17 ____× 2__ = 34\n\n**34 = 34 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (48, 37, 25)\n\n(48 - 37)__ × 2 = __**25 - 5**__\n\n__11 ____× 2__ = 20\n\n22 ≠ 20 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (44, 20, 54)\n\n(44 - 20)__ × 2 = __**54 - 5**__\n\n__24 ____× 2__ = 49\n\n48 ≠ 49 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (35, 22, 34)\n\n(35 - 22)__ × 2 = 34 - 5\n\n__13 ____× 2__ = 29\n\n26 ≠ 29 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
